        "updatedAt": "2026-08-04T14:21:49.111Z",
        "changeLog": "• Modpack: Updated Auto Equipment Plus\n• Modpack: Updated Enhanced ModSettingsApi\n• Modpack: Updated Sixth Sense\n• Modpack: Updated Spotted Status\n• Modpack: Updated Tomato.gg\n\nThere was a weird bug in my sixth sense mod sometimes preventing to show the icon while getting spotted. (you could only hear the sound)\nSpotted Status got reworked and you can configure it using ModSettingsApi+ (not OldSkool Mods) and adjust the X offset if it has wrong position for you."
      },
